<title>USA: Mac Frugal's names Batchelder chairman.</title>
<headline>Mac Frugal's names Batchelder chairman.</headline>
<dateline>DOMINGUEZ, Calif. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mac Frugal's Bargains * Close- outs Inc on Wednesday named David Batchelder chairman.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said Batchelder replaces Peter Willmott who resigned in order to spend full-time as chief executive officer of Zenith Electronics.</p>
</text>
